    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Loft5", "status": "ok", "body": "F17.b0", "volume": 12566.370614359172, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "faces": 4, "has_face": "F17:side(c1)#1"}},

  {"comment": "A rounded tip (Loft6, F18; the reference model loft_point_tangent): the 20 mm circle of Sketch7 up to a point 20 mm above, the tip leaving each point by its distance from the axis per the span: r = 10 (1 - t), z = 20 - 20 (1 - t)^2, the paraboloid, V = 1000 pi."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "loft", "sections": [
    {"type": "profile", "sketch": "F13", "region": "r{c1}"}, {"type": "point", "point": {"point": [0, 0, 20]}}],
    "end_condition": {"type": "point_tangent", "weight": 1}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Loft6", "status": "ok", "body": "F18.b0", "volume": 3141.592653589793, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "faces": 2}},

  {"comment": "A face with holes lofts its outer boundary (mitcad#1183). A 20 mm post 20 high (Sketch9 F19, Extrude2 F20) with a 10 mm hole cut through it (Sketch10 F21, Extrude3 F22), its top lofted to a 10 mm circle 40 mm up (Sketch11 F23 on Plane3, Loft7 F24): the volumes of the tangent and smooth lofts from the post without the hole (geometry suite), M = sqrt(425): tangent pi (40 M / 7 + 27700 / 21), smooth pi (67675 M / 12012 + 405595 * 20 / 6006)."},
